@repertoire = http://localhost:5001
@practice = http://localhost:5002

### 1. Health check — Repertoire
GET {{repertoire}}/health

### 2. Health check — Practice
GET {{practice}}/health

### 3. Create a piece (Repertoire) — 201 Created
# @name createPiece
POST {{repertoire}}/pieces
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Nocturne in E-flat major, Op. 9 No. 2",
  "composer": "Frederic Chopin",
  "genre": 2,
  "difficulty": 2,
  "key": "E-flat major",
  "referenceUrl": "https://imslp.org/wiki/Nocturnes,_Op.9_(Chopin,_Frederic)"
}

### 4. List pieces (Repertoire)
GET {{repertoire}}/pieces

### 5. List pieces filtered by status/genre (Repertoire)
GET {{repertoire}}/pieces?status=0&genre=2

### 6. Get a single piece by id — replace {{pieceId}} with the id from step 3's response
@pieceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{repertoire}}/pieces/{{pieceId}}

### 7. Update piece details (Repertoire) — cannot touch Status or Record
PUT {{repertoire}}/pieces/{{pieceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Nocturne in E-flat major, Op. 9 No. 2",
  "composer": "Frederic Chopin",
  "genre": 2,
  "difficulty": 2,
  "key": "E-flat major",
  "referenceUrl": "https://imslp.org/wiki/Nocturnes,_Op.9_(Chopin,_Frederic)"
}

### 8. Register a practice session (Practice) — 201 Created, publishes PracticeSessionRegistered
# @name createSession
POST {{practice}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
  "pieceTitle": "Nocturne in E-flat major, Op. 9 No. 2",
  "startedAtUtc": "2026-08-19T18:00:00Z",
  "durationMinutes": 25,
  "tempoBpm": 66,
  "focus": 1,
  "quality": 4,
  "notes": "Worked the left-hand arpeggios slowly"
}

### 9. List sessions (Practice)
GET {{practice}}/sessions

### 10. List sessions filtered by piece/date range (Practice)
GET {{practice}}/sessions?pieceId={{pieceId}}&from=2026-08-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-08-31T00:00:00Z

### 11. Get a single session by id — replace with the id from step 8's response
@sessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{practice}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}

### 12. Re-fetch the piece (Repertoire) — after a moment, Record should reflect step 8
# and Status should have moved Backlog -> Learning automatically
GET {{repertoire}}/pieces/{{pieceId}}

### 13. Try to master a piece with zero practice sessions — expect 409
POST {{repertoire}}/pieces
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Etude that has never been practiced",
  "composer": null,
  "genre": 7,
  "difficulty": 0,
  "key": null,
  "referenceUrl": null
}

###
# @name createUnpracticedPiece
POST {{repertoire}}/pieces
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Etude that has never been practiced",
  "composer": null,
  "genre": 7,
  "difficulty": 0,
  "key": null,
  "referenceUrl": null
}

### 14. Change status straight to Mastered without practice — expect 409 Conflict
@unpracticedPieceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
PATCH {{repertoire}}/pieces/{{unpracticedPieceId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Mastered"
}

### 15. Change status through the legal path: Learning -> Polishing
PATCH {{repertoire}}/pieces/{{pieceId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Polishing"
}

### 16. Change status: Polishing -> Mastered (now legal, session exists)
PATCH {{repertoire}}/pieces/{{pieceId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Mastered"
}

### 17. Delete a piece (Repertoire) — 204 No Content
DELETE {{repertoire}}/pieces/{{pieceId}}

### 18. Get a deleted / unknown piece — 404
GET {{repertoire}}/pieces/{{pieceId}}

### 19. Get an unknown session — 404
GET {{practice}}/sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 20. Malformed request — invalid focus/quality — 400 Problem Details
POST {{practice}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
  "pieceTitle": "Whatever",
  "startedAtUtc": "2026-08-19T18:00:00Z",
  "durationMinutes": 25,
  "tempoBpm": 66,
  "focus": 1,
  "quality": 9,
  "notes": null
}
